message: "If you use this benchmark or dataset, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Half a Firewall: Execution-Based Evaluation of IPv6 Policy Coverage in LLM-Generated Linux Firewall Configurations"
abstract: >-
  An execution-based benchmark measuring whether Linux firewall configurations
  generated by large language models enforce the same security policy over IPv4
  and IPv6, with a defect taxonomy and an evaluation of prompting, retrieval,
  and repair interventions.
